<script lang="ts">import { route } from '../lib/stores/router';let topic=$derived(new URLSearchParams($route.split('?')[1]||'').get('topic')||'delivery');</script>
<div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP, WHEN YOU NEED IT</span><h1>Here for your story.</h1><p>Everything you need to explore the RAQVOI demo.</p></div><section class="help-layout"><nav aria-label="Help topics"><a class:active={topic==='delivery'} href="#/help">Delivery & returns</a><a class:active={topic==='sizing'} href="#/help?topic=sizing">Size guide</a><a class:active={topic==='contact'} href="#/help?topic=contact">Contact & FAQs</a><a class:active={topic==='privacy'} href="#/help?topic=privacy">Privacy & demo data</a></nav><div class="help-content">{#if topic==='sizing'}<h2>A comfortable fit.</h2><p>Each product page includes an illustrative size guide from XS to XXL. Open “Size guide” beside the size selector to see sample bust, waist, and hip measurements in centimetres.</p><p>These are demo measurements. Real garment measurements and stock availability will be added with the final catalogue.</p><a class="button dark" href="#/shop">Explore pieces ↗</a>{:else if topic==='contact'}<h2>A few helpful answers.</h2><details open><summary>Can I really buy these products?</summary><p>No. This is a functional static store demonstration with illustrative products, prices and imagery. Checkout creates only a sample order in your browser.</p></details><details><summary>How do the offers work?</summary><p>Use WELCOME15 for 15% off or HER10 for 10% off in the bag. One code can be applied at a time, including to sample sale items. Shipping is not discounted.</p></details><details><summary>Where is my order confirmation email?</summary><p>No email is sent. Your sample confirmation appears on screen and in the demo account page.</p></details><details><summary>How can I contact RAQVOI?</summary><p>Email care@raqvoi.com for enquiries.</p></details>{:else if topic==='privacy'}<h2>Your demo data.</h2><p>The bag, wishlist, selected offer, and sample order information are stored in localStorage on this browser. They are not sent to a database or payment provider.</p><p>Use sample names and email addresses at checkout. Email OTP login is live: your email is processed by our authentication service and email provider. Your name, WhatsApp number and date of birth are stored on our server when you save your account profile. Customer passwords are not required. No payments are processed.</p><p>Clearing browser storage removes browser-local demo data, but does not delete your server account. Account deletion and email changes are still being implemented; contact care@raqvoi.com for help. Newsletter entries are not submitted or permanently stored.</p><a class="button dark" href="#/account">Manage your account ↗</a>{:else}<h2>Delivery & returns.</h2><div class="checkout-alert"><strong>Concept policies for a demo store. No real order or shipment is created.</strong></div><details open><summary>Demo delivery charges</summary><p>₹99 for a product subtotal below ₹3,500. Complimentary at ₹3,500 and above. The qualifying subtotal is calculated before offer codes.</p></details><details><summary>Order tracking</summary><p>Sample orders are visible in your demo account. They do not have a courier, tracking number, or delivery date.</p></details><details><summary>Returns & exchanges</summary><p>No goods are sold in this demonstration, so returns and exchanges are not processed. The final policy will be added before launch.</p></details>{/if}</div></section>
